\n    outDyna = dynaClass.newInstance();\n    for (final String outKey : inMap.keySet())\n    {\n        outDyna.set(outKey, inMap.get(outKey));\n    }\n    // Set up BeanUtilsBean instance we will use bu = BeanUtilsBean.getInstance();\n}\n```"
